 "remarks": "A remarkable home where historic charm has been completely reimagined for modern living, set on over two acres in one of New Canaan's most coveted locations. Impeccably cared for and thoughtfully updated throughout, this stately residence offers over 7,000 square feet of beautifully appointed interiors with six bedrooms, six-and-a-half bathrooms, custom millwork and moldings, soaring ceilings, and exceptional attention to detail. A welcoming entry and adjoining office open to an elegant living room with double-sided gas fireplace and formal dining room with butler's pantry. Designed equally for effortless entertaining and everyday living, the heart of the home is an extraordinary custom kitchen with ample storage opening to an impressive, light-filled family room. Multiple French doors extend the living spaces outdoors to the rear porches, sweeping lawns, and pool. A powder room, two bedrooms, full bath, and mudroom provide added flexibility on the main level. Upstairs, the luxurious primary suite is a true retreat with fireplace, balcony, spa-like bath, and three walk-in closets. Three additional bedrooms, three bathrooms, a second family room, and laundry room complete the second level. The lower level offers additional living space with a bonus room, access to the three-car garage, and a fabulous cabana room with wet bar, updated full bath, and sliding doors opening directly to the pool for effortless summer entertaining.",
